---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: evolution (WhatsApp (Evolution API))

## minimal config
{
  "api_key": "secret-api_key",
  "instance": "vigilant",
  "number": "4712345678",
  "server": "https://evolution.example.com"
}

### down
POST https://evolution.example.com/message/sendText/vigilant
apikey: secret-api_key
(json)
{
  "number": "4712345678",
  "text": "🔴 Payments API is down — HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
}

### up
POST https://evolution.example.com/message/sendText/vigilant
apikey: secret-api_key
(json)
{
  "number": "4712345678",
  "text": "🟢 Payments API is back up — down for 12m 4s\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
}

